<div class='doc-title'>RESPONSIBLE PRECIOUS METALS SUPPLY CHAIN POLICY & UNDERTAKING</div>

<p>
<strong>LBH BULLION GOLD TRADING L.L.C</strong> is committed to conducting all precious metals dealings with integrity, transparency, and strict adherence to ethical standards. We recognize our shared responsibility with all counterparties to maintain a conflict-free, responsible, and transparent supply chain. Our company fully aligns with and commits to:
</p>

<ul>
  <li>OECD Due Diligence Guidance for Responsible Supply Chains of Minerals from Conflict-Affected and High-Risk Areas (Annex II).</li>
  <li>LBMA Responsible Gold Guidance & Responsible Silver Guidance.</li>
  <li>World Gold Council Conflict-Free Gold Standard.</li>
  <li>UAE Ministry of Economy (MOEC) Regulatory Framework for Due Diligence in Gold Sourcing.</li>
</ul>

<h4>1. Zero Tolerance for Human Rights Violations</h4>
<p>LBH Bullion Gold Trading L.L.C shall neither participate in nor benefit from any form of human rights abuse, including torture, cruel or degrading treatment, forced labor, child labor, sexual violence, war crimes, or other gross violations of international law. We will immediately suspend or discontinue engagement with any supplier where a reasonable risk of such abuses is identified.</p>

<h4>2. No Support to Non-State Armed Groups</h4>
<p>We strictly prohibit any direct or indirect support to non-state armed groups through the extraction, trade, handling, or export of precious metals, or payments or assistance to entities that illegally control mine sites, transportation routes, or trade points.</p>

<h4>3. Anti-Bribery and Anti-Corruption</h4>
<p>We do not offer, promise, give, solicit, or accept bribes or improper inducements, resisting any attempt to conceal the origin of precious metals, taxes, royalties, or official government fees.</p>

<h4>4. Anti-Money Laundering & Sanctions Compliance</h4>
<p>We enforce a rigorous AML/CFT framework compliant with UAE Federal Decree-Law No. (20) of 2018 and FATF standards. All counterparties are systematically screened against UAE, UN, OFAC, EU, and UK sanctions lists.</p>

<div class='box'>
  <h4 style='margin-top:0;'>COUNTERPARTY SUPPLY CHAIN UNDERTAKING</h4>
  <p>By signing this document, we hereby confirm that:</p>
  <ul style='margin-bottom:0;'>
    <li>We have implemented an adequate supply chain due diligence system in accordance with the OECD Due Diligence Guidance.</li>
    <li>We comply with all applicable national and international laws governing the trade of precious metals.</li>
    <li>We do not source or trade precious metals originating from conflict-affected or high-risk areas without enhanced due diligence.</li>
    <li>We commit to full compliance with this Supply Chain Policy in all transactions with LBH BULLION GOLD TRADING L.L.C.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

